    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch01-17: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.53";
    dc:description "Selection signatures are widespread, but a common causal accounting across all domestic plants and animals is not available. Existing data can evaluate predominance in individual lineages only.";
