    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Across domestic lineages, partition phenotypic change among selection, drift, environment, use, correlation and crossing using genomic time series and pedigrees. Selection explaining a clearly larger share than each rival supports predominance.";
